OL,3,AMan charged with attacking Australian
OL,4,AMP, as suspect's father says she is
OL,5,Afamily friend
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice say a man has been charged over
OL,8,Fthe alleged attack on an Australian MP
OL,9,Fon Monday
OL,11,FThe 43-year-old suspect has been
OL,12,Fcharged with dangerous driving causing
OL,13,Fserious injury; intentionally causing
OL,14,Fserious injury; and causing harm to a
OL,15,FCommonwealth public official
OL,17,FPolice say they "will allege the
OL,18,Fincident was targeted". The suspect is
OL,19,Fdue in court on Wednesday - pictures
OL,20,Fshow him being detained on Monday
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
