OL,3,AMan charged with attacking Australian
OL,4,AMP, as suspect's father says she is
OL,5,Afamily friend
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe suspect has not been formally
OL,8,Fidentified, but he was named by local
OL,9,Fmedia as Brendan Nugent
OL,11,FHis father, Rod, says he and his
OL,12,Fpartner were friends with Helen Haines
OL,13,F"for more than 20 years", and calls the
OL,14,Fattack "devastating and unfathomable"
OL,16,FHaines, 65, is in a critical but stable
OL,17,Fcondition and has reportedly lost a leg
OL,18,Fafter being hit by the suspect's car
OL,19,Foutside her office in Victoria
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
